      "message": "The only known user who might care is Flutter, but at this point iOS12 devices are a rounding error. It looks like iOS13 and iOS14 are also rounding errors, with iOS15 being the oldest with any significant use. However, our physical test devices are mostly iOS13 and the most benefit is from removing iOS12 support.\n\nIn addition, the \"iOS12\" devices are actually iOS13 anyway. It\u0027s just the build target that is set to iOS12. There hasn\u0027t actually been any testing on an iOS12 device in quite some time.",
      "revId": "c1d55a2010057d31fbe5841a6ceb5c7c0351d544",
