      "writtenOn": "2025-06-04T20:09:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just to give an idea, the last device that could not update to iOS13 was the iPhone 6 (last sold September 12, 2018). The iPhone 6s, iPhone 6s Plus, and iPhone 7 go to iOS15, which is probably why 13 and 14 aren\u0027t seen very often. (There may be an iPad that was sold later with this restriction, but I\u0027m having difficulty tracking that down.)",
